From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 13:17:43 -0700
Subject: GL: Reset base level for ASTC compressed image uploads

Rename ResetBaseLevelForASTCSubImage workaround to
ResetBaseLevelForASTCImage, and apply it to glCompressedTexImage2D
in addition to glCompressedTexSubImage2D. For ASTC textures when
base_level > 0, base_level is reset to 0 before calling
glCompressedTexImage2D or glCompressedTexSubImage2D and restored to
its original value afterwards to work around a PowerVR driver bug.

Bug: chromium:551708184
Change-Id: Ia0218a2148ae007a15773fe7bb58b723f5159e9d
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/angle/angle/+/8315907
Reviewed-by: Kenneth Russell <kbr@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Geoff Lang <geofflang@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Zhenyao Mo <zmo@chromium.org>

